======================================================================
  VERDICT ON ORIGINAL CLAIMS
======================================================================

  P_7 -> Hamming [7,4,3]?
    Raw A as parity-check: [7,3,4]
    This is the [7,3,4] SIMPLEX code = dual of Hamming [7,4,3].
    The claim is HALF-RIGHT: A defines the Hamming code, but as
    GENERATOR matrix (rowspace), not parity-check (nullspace).
    A as GENERATOR matrix: [7,4,3] = Hamming [7,4,3]. CONFIRMED.

  P_23 -> Golay [23,12,7]?
    Raw A as parity-check: [23,11,8]
    A as generator matrix: [23,12,7]
    Bordered QR matrix:    [24,11,8]
    Bordered (A+I):        [24,11,8]
    GOLAY [23,12,7] found via: A+I
    GOLAY [23,12,7] found via: generator

  P_11 analysis:
